  "description": "Reid Roadster | 16 inch kids' bike\nThe perfect first pedal bike for 3–6 year olds, the Reid Roadster 16\" Kids' Bike combines timeless vintage styling with child-friendly design, comfort and dependable performance.\nInspired by our popular adult vintage bikes, the Roadster 16\" features classic styling with a lightweight frame and durable components designed specifically for young riders. Its comfortable riding position makes it easy for children to build confidence as they learn to pedal, steer and explore on two wheels.\nSafety and control are key for growing riders. The front dual-pivot caliper brake provides reliable stopping power with a lever designed for smaller hands, while the rear coaster brake offers simple, intuitive stopping by pedalling backwards.\nWhether they're heading to the park, exploring the neighbourhood or joining a family bike ride, the Reid Roadster 16\" combines classic style with everyday practicality to make every ride fun.\nWho is the Roadster for?\nThe Roadster 16\" Kids' Bike is ideal for:\n\n3–6 year olds ready for their first pedal bike\nYoung riders developing confidence on two wheels\nChildren learning to pedal, steer and brake independently\nKids who love classic, vintage-inspired bike styling\nParents looking for a comfortable and durable kids' bike\nEveryday adventures, from park trips to family bike rides\n\nFind the right fit\nChoosing the right bike size helps your child ride comfortably, confidently and safely. Use our Kids' Bike Size Guide by clicking the tab above to find the right Reid bike based on your child's height and age.",
